{'symbol': 'VICI', 'date': '2022-10-18 16:15:00', 'title': 'VICI PROPERTIES INC. ANNOUNCES PARTNERSHIP WITH CANYON RANCH WITH INVESTMENT IN CANYON RANCH AUSTIN IN AUSTIN, TEXAS', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--VICI PROPERTIES INC. (NYSE: VICI) (“VICI,” “VICI PROPERTIES” OR THE “COMPANY”), AN EXPERIENTIAL REAL ESTATE INVESTMENT TRUST, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO A DELAYED DRAW TERM LOAN FACILITY FOR UP TO $200 MILLION (THE “LOAN FACILITY”) TO FUND THE DEVELOPMENT OF CANYON RANCH'S NEWEST WELLNESS-RESORT OFFERING, CANYON RANCH AUSTIN IN AUSTIN, TEXAS."}